{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11301490","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11301490","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130149001:1":{"text":"소렌과 아르사는 사나운 짐승을 사냥한 경험은 많지만, 강자와 대결을 해본 경험은 그다지 없어요.","source_cn":"索恩和阿尔萨虽然之前猎杀过很多凶猛的野兽，但他们很少有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDECC667FE16293C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130149002:1":{"text":"게다가 우르 부족은 다른 부족에서 버림받은 어린 트라이브들이 모여있는 곳이잖아요.","source_cn":"而且乌尔聚落，都是被其他部落遗弃的弱小蛮血……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73A1C0A1E0640751","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130149003:1":{"text":"우르 부족이 아닌 다른 곳에는 강자가 끊이질 않는데...","source_cn":"乌尔之外的部落里，从来都不缺乏强者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DC982CD98F2FA29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:小蛮血瑟拉芬":{"text":"세라핀","source":"小蛮血瑟拉芬","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}